{#- Every post-derived value goes through `inert`: `<` / `>` become `&lt;` / `&gt;`, so a
    `</enquiry>` or `</example>` inside a post cannot close the delimiters below. -#}
{% if examples -%}
## Recent team decisions (learn from these; they override the built-in examples when they disagree)

{% for ex in examples -%}
<example index="{{ loop.index }}">
Post: {{ ex.text | inert }}
{% if ex.decision == "accept" -%}
Team decision: ACCEPT (genuine)
{%- else -%}
Team decision: DISCARD — reason: {{ (ex.reason or "not a fit") | inert }}
{%- endif %}
{%- if ex.is_override and ex.ai_verdict %} (AI originally said {{ ex.ai_verdict }}; the team overrode it){% endif %}
</example>

{% endfor -%}
{% endif -%}
## Enquiry to triage

<enquiry>
Author: {{ (author_name or "unknown") | inert }}
Headline: {{ (author_headline or "unknown") | inert }}
Date posted: {{ date_posted or "unknown" }}
URL: {{ (source_url or "unknown") | inert }}
Text:
{{ text | inert }}
</enquiry>

Call `record_triage` now with every field.
